      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后富士奇石为了精益求精，\n不断反复做了许多尝试。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fb33e61efce7148f871271cd703bc6d618e38a16f1beac9223847ed33801fc6",
