      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就一天的训练量来说，这样实在太多了。\n当我抬起头要告诉她这是最后一轮时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "865a3cff5cfc3b152ac1c7d0576079f87db7cacf9add93762350afcb17ccecb6",
