      "source_text": "总而言之……\n富士奇石最后所展现的速度是前所未见的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e03155d27b6b6cea0baa33556c161fe7a1abde19d44c1ae21ffda641472de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
