    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aebd8f3f6373a9e33fbb36fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够跑出这么快的速度，\n那么达成三冠也越来越不像是单纯痴人说梦了。\n而且更重要的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bdb48c571bc3a8d986f42a280149fb2d0bb1ed122469226006225f485cc90b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005305.json",
      "json_path": [
