      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家都心怀期待等着看我的表现。\n一想到这点，我就觉得坐立难安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5adbf78e86df72d15f54473255002152beee72b1a688235e75eeeb881bf770",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
